<p>AZMATON KI MAALIKA BAAZAR MEIN....</p>

<p>Azmaton ki Maalika bazar mein (x5)...<br>
Haaye Zainab (s.a) be rida bazaar mein...</p>

<p>1] Shaam walon ne Sajaya shaam ko,<br>
daawaten bheji hujoom e aam ko...<br>
Laaye phir aale aba bazaar mein...</p>

<p>2] Ek khutba aapne aisa padha,<br>
Ek sahabi peet kar kehta raha...<br>
Aa gaye ya Murtaza (a.s) bazaar mein...</p>

<p>3] Sar ke khoon me tar hai jiski ab jabeen,<br>
Dar haqeeqat shaamion Zainab (s.a) nahi...<br>
Aa rahin hain Fatima (s.a) bazaar mein...</p>

<p>4] Ae khuda usko bohot tauqeer de,<br>
Dard e ahlebait (a.s) ki jageer de...<br>
Jisne ye nauha suna bazaar mein...</p>

<p>5] Hai kathin bazar wale marhale<br>
Ek rassi se bandhe baara gale<br>
Khoon abid ro raha bazar me</p>

<p>6] Shamiyo me warise thatheer hu<br>
Or haya o sharm ki tafseer hu<br>
Binte zehra ne kaha bazar me</p>

<p>7] Zaqmi chehre pe tha balou ka naqaab<br>
Shaam walo se tha zainab ka khitaab<br>
Ro rahi thi har ada bazar me</p>

<p>8] Kon Hai Jo Khauf Se Soyi Nahi<br>
Shimr Se Sehmi Hai Yu Royi Nahi<br>
Kiska Bandha Hai Gala Bazaar Mein</p>

<p>Azmaton Ki Malika Bazaar Mein</p>